If I'd been taken alive and turned over to the police,

01:19:51.790 --> 01:19:53.470
my memory would have been dispersed

01:19:53.470 --> 01:19:56.500
and all of my unregistered formulas lost forever.

01:19:57.640 --> 01:19:59.970
But dead, they were able to save me.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:08.370
and my memory how long have you had the process almost a year you two are the first full cycle

01:20:08.370 --> 01:20:16.700
transplants what do you do now wait for the leaders to die and then reactivate them when

01:20:17.370 --> 01:20:23.440
the time is right you will announce that you've achieved immortality when the rush for applications

01:20:23.440 --> 01:20:26.440
is over you'll probably be deified

01:20:32.300 --> 01:20:33.640
So the machines take over.

01:20:34.890 --> 01:20:40.800
Kragus, is it true there will be nothing but machines?

01:20:43.960 --> 01:20:44.960
We are machines?

01:20:59.100 --> 01:20:59.420
You're a...

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:15.100
beauty you know beauty how do you feel toward maxine i love her and you i love him very much

01:21:15.100 --> 01:21:27.200
that's a lot for a couple of godless soulless robots are you godless cragus search yourself

01:21:27.200 --> 01:21:29.970
it's important are you godless

01:21:32.100 --> 01:21:38.800
No. No, I don't think so. I'm not.

01:21:39.160 --> 01:21:40.560
Then you can't be soulless.

01:21:40.800 --> 01:21:43.180
Look, a man may have his leg amputated.

01:21:43.580 --> 01:21:45.720
Is his soul decreased by that loss?

01:21:46.530 --> 01:21:46.910
No.

01:21:47.130 --> 01:21:48.490
Not even a fraction of 1%?

01:21:49.110 --> 01:21:49.690
Of course not.

01:21:50.000 --> 01:21:51.740
What if a man loses both legs?

01:21:52.260 --> 01:21:53.860
A negative can't be compounded.

01:21:54.340 --> 01:21:55.400
The soul would be the same.

01:21:56.180 --> 01:21:57.540
You'd just get artificial legs.

01:21:58.350 --> 01:21:59.810
You've just received an artificial...

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:15.610
body a new body ageless tireless disease free and renewable every 200 years changed except maybe a

01:22:15.610 --> 01:22:22.890
few chemicals in effect well that transplant must include the soul no only the memory which

01:22:22.890 --> 01:22:29.930
includes the faith that there is a soul whatever it is you seem

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:34.940
And when the entire human race has been transplanted,

01:22:35.780 --> 01:22:36.960
death will cease to exist.

01:22:41.090 --> 01:22:43.250
And birth will cease to exist, too.

01:22:46.190 --> 01:22:48.970
The most precious hope of every woman.

01:22:50.750 --> 01:22:54.720
How do you think these two R-96s would like to pick up four points?

01:22:57.080 --> 01:22:59.380
You can raise them to R-100s?

01:23:01.920 --> 01:23:03.480
Make them propagate themselves?

01:23:05.590 --> 01:23:08.810
I worked it all out prior to my recent death and resurrection.

01:23:09.840 --> 01:23:12.540
I didn't want to turn it over to you until I didn't need you anymore.

01:23:13.620 --> 01:23:16.540
Now, I don't, since we're all on the same side.

01:23:18.880 --> 01:23:19.620
How about it, you two?

01:23:20.720 --> 01:23:22.610
We'll take several simple operations.

01:23:23.560 --> 01:23:26.880
Hardly more difficult than removing a rib.

01:23:28.560 --> 01:23:29.620
Somebody has to be first.

01:23:31.600 --> 01:23:34.500
Self-procreating.

01:23:36.440 --> 01:23:38.120
Pretty sloppy way of doing things,

01:23:38.220 --> 01:23:41.500
but it fulfills a certain psychological need.

01:23:42.490 --> 01:23:47.270
Paradoxical is my life seeking immortality on one hand

01:23:47.270 --> 01:23:50.240
and seeking to destroy it on the other.

01:24:03.160 --> 01:24:08.900
Of course the operation was a success, or you wouldn't be here.
